From fd578571fd4408e7a9b4ce4047ebc4eefe5ea38b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 04:19:18 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] clk: qcom: gcc-kaanapali: Tie the CX power domain to
 controller

Enable runtime PM for the controller, allowing CX to be powered down
once all GCC consumers have released their clocks and GDSCs.

Fixes: d1919c375f21 ("clk: qcom: Add support for Global clock controller on Kaanapali")
Reviewed-by: Konrad Dybcio <konrad.dybcio@oss.qualcomm.com>
Signed-off-by: Abel Vesa <abel.vesa@oss.qualcomm.com>
Link: https://patch.msgid.link/20260924-qcom-tie-cx-to-gcc-v5-15-38732033e5b5@oss.qualcomm.com
Signed-off-by: Bjorn Andersson <andersson@kernel.org>

(cherry picked from commit 18c75784e4a9db5ed8cf6818a29ec0ac15ea2c8b)
[ upstream author: Abel Vesa <abel.vesa@oss.qualcomm.com>; picked for the iceland kernel q89 ]
Signed-off-by: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 drivers/clk/qcom/gcc-kaanapali.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/clk/qcom/gcc-kaanapali.c b/drivers/clk/qcom/gcc-kaanapali.c
index 1087967a1f..1ea5bd2463 100644
--- a/drivers/clk/qcom/gcc-kaanapali.c
+++ b/drivers/clk/qcom/gcc-kaanapali.c
@@ -3505,6 +3505,7 @@ static const struct qcom_cc_desc gcc_kaanapali_desc = {
 	.num_resets = ARRAY_SIZE(gcc_kaanapali_resets),
 	.gdscs = gcc_kaanapali_gdscs,
 	.num_gdscs = ARRAY_SIZE(gcc_kaanapali_gdscs),
+	.use_rpm = true,
 	.driver_data = &gcc_kaanapali_driver_data,
 };
 
